A '''Lotum''' is a [[Critter]] that can be [[Hunting|Hunted]] on the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Lotums''' spawn naturally in the water of the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Lotums''' walk or swim around before standing still. If a player clicks on a '''Lotum''', it will gain the glowing effect and jump to a nearby lotus flower with a trail of green particles up to {{Green|4}} times per click. After the {{Green|4th}} time, the {{Item|Lotum Shard}} is dropped.

The amount of times a '''Lotum''' jumps can be reduced by {{green|1}} using the {{Attr|Frog Legs}} attribute.

